        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima MUKAMA yaatuma Nasani ahari Daudi. Yaija ah'ari, yaamugira ati: Hakaba hariho abashaija babiri omu rurembo, omwe ari omutungi, n'ondi ari omworo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogwo mutungi akaba aine amasyo maingi g'entaama n'ag'ente, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwonka ogwo mworo akaba ataine kindi eki atungire, kureka akaagazi k'entaama kamwe, aku yaabaire aguzire. Yaakoorora, kaakurira owe n'abaana be; kaaguma nikarya aha tw'okurya twe, nikanywera aha kikopo kye, kandi nikabyama omu kifuba kye; kaaba nka muhara we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eizooba rimwe ogwo mutungi yaaraarirwa omugyenyi; kwonka tiyaayenda kubaagira ogwo muhinguzi owaamuraarira omu masyo ge g'entaama nari ag'ente, kureka yaatwara ako kataama k'ori mworo, yaaba niko yaamubaagira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ku yaakihuriire, yaagirira ogwo mushaija ekiniga kingi munonga, yaagira Nasani ati: Nindahira MUKAMA otahwaho, omushaija okozire ekyo kintu akaabaire ow'okufa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.22.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 22:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.19.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 19:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mbwenu arihe ako kataama kana ahabw'okukora ekyo n'ahabw'okutagira saasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
